      "description": "{\"value\":\"Apportionment Population for 50 states as of April 1, 2020. Includes the resident population, as ascertained by the 24th Decennial Census under Title 13, U.S. Code, & counts of U.S. military & federal civilian employees living overseas (and their dependents living with them overseas) allocated to their home state, as reported by the employing federal agencies. Overseas count used for apportionment purposes only. Values for DC & Puerto Rico calculated by summing resident & overseas population. \",\"fieldValueType\":\"countOrAmount\"}"
